# Gleaming Bastion: "{T}: Add {W} or {U}. Activate only if this land entered this turn or if you control a basic land."
# Turn 1 it entered this turn, so {U} is offered with no other land at all. On turn 3 Bot1 controls only a Tundra
# (Plains and Island types but not basic, CR 205.4a) and Bot2 controls a Plains (not Bot1's): {W} is refused (the
# refusal) while {C} is still offered. On turn 5 a basic Island of Bot1's turns the ability back on (the positive
# control: the same action, the same land, no longer entered this turn).

[Bot1 Deck]
Gleaming Bastion
Tundra
Island
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Gleaming Bastion.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleaming Bastion.Activate(Ability: or; Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Tundra.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Gleaming Bastion.Activate(Ability: or; Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleaming Bastion.Activate(Ability: {C})
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleaming Bastion.Activate(Ability: or; Color: White)

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {W}
